     {
       "requirement_id": "008-settings-cli:AC-006",
       "disposition": "covered",
-      "rationale": "The Domain trait supplies command schema/help, file/dash input, pure validation, preview, typed patches and export. Existing output settings delegate to the same descriptors; no later production domain is shipped early. Valid dry-run is fully validated without persistence/revision/effects; invalid preview is rejected. Exact production-domain help and atomic bulk/export behavior are tested using the approved test-only fixture. Future domain business policy remains with its owning feature.",
